    "title": "Dan Ives Says He Would Be 'Shocked' If SPCX, TSLA Don't Merge Within A Year – Adds Tesla Shareholders Could Back Deal If Valuation Is Right",
    "byline": null,
    "published_at": null,
    "site_name": "finance.yahoo.com",
